  "body": "### Description\n\nI used to be able to open media links of this format in a new tab:\r\nhttps://server.com/_matrix/media/v3/download/server.com/media-id\r\n\r\nNow, the default behavior is to download them, instead of opening them. I am running the latest Synapse.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUsing Element, attach an image. Middle-click the posted image.\n\n### Homeserver\n\nMy own homeserver originally, and it affects any server running the latest synapse\n\n### Synapse Version\n\nv1.88.0\n\n### Installation Method\n\nDocker (matrixdotorg/synapse)\n\n### Database\n\nPostgreSQL, single server\n\n### Workers\n\nSingle process\n\n### Platform\n\nN/A\n\n### Configuration\n\n_No response_\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\nN/A\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
